  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with multiprofile and scvi_n200 encoder (config_005) achieve the highest accuracy so far. This experiment tests adding image data (resnet50) to this strong baseline, isolating the effect of multimodal integration. It balances exploitation (building on a proven RNA-only setup) and exploration (testing if image data improves performance), while keeping other parameters consistent to attribute any gains to the addition of image modality."
